{"file_name": "1aa353e675cd9cdf.pdf", "category": "hr", "text": "5\n\nEli Simmons\n\nHUMAN RESOURCES\nPROFESSIONAL\n\nDetails\n\n6588 Fountainhead Drive\nStamford, CT 06903\nUnited States\n\n(203) 706-2234\n\nSkills\n\nExcellent Communication Skills\nHR Policies and Regulations\n\nAdvanced Software System\nKnowledge\n\nEvent Planning\nEmployment Laws\n\nMediation Skills\n\nProfile\n\nExperienced and self-motivated Human Resources Professional with two years of\nindustry experience administering policies and procedures in the Human Resources\nDepartment of a fast-moving technology company. Adept in implementing\nprograms and changes that enhance company position and lead to success.\nKnowledgeable about employment law and effective organizational planning.\nProven track record of successfully managing Human Resources efforts and serving\nas a crucial pillar of support for HR teams and employees.\n\nEmployment History\n\nHuman Resources Professional, Millbank & Cone, Stamford, CT\n\ne Assisted in creating documentation for all new hires and continued to build\nfiles in accordance with HR protocol.\n\ne Created a compliance log intended for management use each month.\n\ne Assisted in maintaining all hard copy files for the HR department.\n\ne Developed and implemented company policies and codes that supported\nlong-term and short-term goals.\n\ne Assisted in updating all benefits information, while extending important\nknowledge pertaining to benefits to employees.\n\nHuman Resources Assistant, Millbank and Cone, Danbury, CT\n\ne Worked as a reliable and dedicated team member in the HR department,\ndedicated to fostering the company mission.\n\ne Assisted with recruitment, interviews, and hiring.\n\ne Distributed employee handbooks and answered questions and concerns.\n\ne Reported important events and incidents to senior HR members.\n\ne Handled paperwork regarding maternity leave and bereavement.\n\nHuman Resources Assistant, Jones New York, New York\ne Assisted senior HR members with various tasks on a daily basis.\ne Provided new employees with information and training.\ne Organized seminars for employees involving motivation techniques and\nhealthy lifestyle choices.\ne Recorded and reported employee issues and brought them to senior HR\n\nmembers when necessary.\ne Organized and maintained employee records.\n\nEducation\n\nAssociate of Business Administration, Norfolk College, New Haven, CT\n\ne Graduated magna cum laude.\ne Senior Writer at The Lion Publication.\n\nReferences\n\nReferences available upon request", "embedding": [-0.060573067516088486, 0.00955770630389452, 0.004660631064325571, 0.016614772379398346, 0.03869015350937843, -0.025636235252022743, 0.035894475877285004, 0.013714916072785854, -0.04734639450907707, 0.02917405590415001, -0.019586334004998207, 0.014413000084459782, -0.005320161581039429, 0.048965878784656525, 0.013725658878684044, 0.019982757046818733, 0.003355176653712988, 0.002003287896513939, -0.05104165896773338, -0.06966198235750198, 0.06019370257854462, -0.055050402879714966, -0.035972435027360916, -0.07674506306648254, -0.04043881967663765, -0.013581055216491222, -0.04058609902858734, -0.012756835669279099, -0.02424074336886406, -0.09965945035219193, 0.00971207581460476, -0.03033248335123062, 0.052279289811849594, -0.014604121446609497, 0.0597715750336647, 0.08481460809707642, 0.06458703428506851, 0.0228768028318882, 0.003580746939405799, -0.04080360382795334, -0.029068712145090103, -0.06467606872320175, -0.04077897220849991, 0.003566152649000287, -0.05424673110246658, -0.007915548048913479, 0.007563391700387001, -0.023092487826943398, -0.04340141639113426, 0.0538141131401062, -0.05147681385278702, -0.03291604667901993, 0.0856499895453453, -0.007409845944494009, -0.0017118429532274604, 0.04567168653011322, 0.03414805978536606, 0.009971436113119125, -0.0026276414282619953, -0.06406188011169434, -0.02684423327445984, -0.03938882425427437, -0.08263008296489716, 0.004318743944168091, 0.009508911520